surname>Veneziani</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name><name><surname>Fontanini</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Bianco</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Tortora</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Antitumor effects of ZD6474, a small molecule vascular endothelial growth factor receptor tyrosine kinase inhibitor, with additional activity against epidermal growth factor receptor tyrosine kinase</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><volume>9</volume><fpage>1546</fpage><lpage>1556</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12684431</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="bib4"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Colburn</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Biomarkers in drug discovery and development: from target identification through drug marketing</article-title><source>J Clin Pharmacol</source><volume>43</volume><fpage>329</fpage><lpage>341</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12723454</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="bib5"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cummings</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ward</surname><given-names>TH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ranson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dive</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Apoptosis pathway-targeted drugs &#x02013; from the bench to the clinic</article-title><source>Biochim Biophys Acta</source><volume>1705</volume><fpage>53</fpage><lpage>66</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15585173</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Demetri</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>v